    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-43",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4830,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 42,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "09 · 选择与物件变形",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-44",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4892,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 43,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "选择 · 套索多选",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-45",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 4954,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 44,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "V选择，Ctrl+点击增减物件，套索沿范围选择。空白处拖框左往右为蓝实线，只选完全包含；右往左绿虚线，选碰到的物件；Ctrl／Shift拖框追加。多选可整组移动、复制、粘贴、改样式与删除。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-46",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5076,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 45,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "单一形状有八方向缩放与旋转把手，游标显示相对应方向或旋转箭头；线段／箭头为A、B，圆弧有起讫角。图片角落默认等比，Shift自由缩放；旋转Shift吸附15°。锁定物件不参与批次移动／删除，隐藏物件仍留在图层。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-47",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5198,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 46,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "建立物件或单击选择时，只显示大小、旋转、端点等控制点，不自动弹出详细调整列。双击物件才开启详细属性；双击文字进入文字编辑。选择工具可随时切换回绘图，绘图工具不会在每一笔结束後切回 V。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-48",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5376,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 47,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "10 · 属性、色彩与样式",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-49",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5438,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 48,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "线条样式 · 延伸直线",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-50",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5500,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 49,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "属性面板只显示所选物件适用项目，可调线色、粗细、适用的填色／渐层／透明度、文字与几何数值。实线、虚线、点线、点划线提供样本，工具列显示目前样式；可先设绘图偏好，修改选择物件也更新後续绘图设定。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-51",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5622,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按停靠或拖标题到四边，左右直排、上下横排。图层、橡皮擦与尺规有各自入口，避免混入不相关物件属性。延伸直线及箭头头部长宽在对应属性中。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-52",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5770,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 51,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "11 · 文字与便条纸",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-53",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5832,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 52,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "文字 · 便条纸",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-54",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5894,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 53,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "T或便条纸工具後点画布输入，Enter换行，Ctrl+Enter或离开完成，Esc取消，组字不触发工具快捷键。色圆提供字型、粗体、斜体、底线、删除线及对齐；便条纸有折角、纸胶带、猫咪、笔记本、方格及柔和款。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-55",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6016,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 54,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "编辑局部文字格式窗口中先选文字再改格式、文字色或标记色，保存为一笔Undo。文字或草稿右键可调整整框样式；更多文字设定只应用修改字段到本页未锁定文字／便条纸，略过其他物件。屏幕文字支援8–144 pt、自订#RRGGBB、字型、对齐与透明度。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-56",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6194,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 55,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "12 · 橡皮擦",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-57",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6256,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 56,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "橡皮擦",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-58",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6318,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 57,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "选橡皮擦，再点目前工具开设定，选物件擦除／局部笔迹擦除及直径；一般与屏幕画布均以半透明圆显示范围。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-59",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6410,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 58,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "物件擦除整笔移除碰到的笔画或几何；局部擦除只移除划过的笔迹段。文字、便条纸及图片受到保护，删除请选择後按Delete。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-60",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6502,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 59,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "一般画布右下角有原创纸白／雾绿俯视磁吸板擦，按住拖曳依斜放的圆角擦面轮廓擦除，放开回到停靠处并提交一笔可撤销操作；Esc 或失去捕捉会取消整次擦拭。右键板擦选物件或局部笔迹模式，也可隐藏；首页设定→显示板擦可重新开启。擦面以画面大小显示，随缩放换算到作品座标。局部／像素模式只切断笔迹，不修改图片像素或原始 PDF／简报元素；屏幕画布仍使用工具列的圆形橡皮擦。工具列「更多→显示板擦」可随时切换显示并记住选择；板擦呈左高右低，抓取与擦除轮廓同步镜像。 圆形橡皮擦可连续拖曳；擦除预览逐步更新，放开鼠标完成本次擦除并合成一笔撤销操作。Esc或指标捕捉中断会取消尚未完成的擦除。正常保存或退出会等待已放开的擦除完成。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
