    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-65",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7070,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 64,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "13 · 尺规",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-66",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7132,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 65,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "屏幕尺",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-67",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7194,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 66,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "启用尺，拖尺身移动，拖端点旋转；金色支点可移到上下划线边或两端，旋转固定该支点。右键尺或尺设定可调边、0–100%支点位置、0.1°角度、透明度及长度。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-68",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7286,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 67,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "尺长为画布宽度20–150%，默认90%，随窗口大小调整。画笔在尺缘起笔即锁定该边，整笔保持直线，超出尺长仍沿同轴延伸。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-69",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7434,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 68,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "14 · 圆规：准备、锁定、画弧",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-70",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7496,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 69,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "圆规",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-71",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7558,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 70,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "准备时拖圆心、半径与笔尖调位置、半径和起角，不产生物件。点圆心变亮橘色，锁定圆心与半径。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-72",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7650,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 71,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "拖笔尖沿圆周预览有向弧线，跨0°连续计算；放开生成一个可编辑圆弧及一笔Undo。静止点击不产生无效物件；完成弧可等比缩放、旋转与调起讫角。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-73",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7798,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 72,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "15 · 教学提醒：雷射与藤条",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-74",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7860,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 73,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "雷射 · 藤条",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-75",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7922,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "zIndex": 74,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列或更多工具选雷射，再点目前雷射开设定：光点、短尾迹或线条、颜色、直径、粗细、消退时间与白色光芯。屏幕画布同样提供设定。 按住鼠标左键才显示雷射，放开、取消或离开画布即清除光点与尾迹；单纯移动不发光。雷射模式不选择物件，双击、右键与图层点选也不切换成物件编辑；要编辑请先选「选择（V）」。 在「更多」选藤条，或点一般画布板擦旁的原创藤条图示，不需按住拖动；管理页不再放藤条。可在自订工具列勾成常用，排在雷射旁并与选择对齐。选用後藤条在画布内持续跟随游标，以右下握柄为固定挥动点；左键每点一次挥动并播放拍击声，按住或移动不连发，不修改作品或撤销纪录。快捷图示可按右键隐藏，再从更多的「显示藤条」恢复；此偏好会保存。两种画布均可使用藤条。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-76",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8194,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 75,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "按住时尾迹依设定消退，停住仍保留当前光点；雷射不写入永久物件或Undo。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-77",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8312,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 76,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "16 · 计算机与计时器",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-78",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8374,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 77,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "计算机 · 计时器",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-79",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8436,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 78,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "上方＋开计算机或计时器，拖标题移动或收合。计算机提供括号、科学函数、π、e、Ans与键盘／Enter，按插入算式才新增文字物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-80",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8528,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 79,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "计时器有码表、5／15／25分钟倒数及自订秒数；关闭面板仍计时，到时通知，重新开启保留目前状态。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-81",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8676,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 80,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "17 · 图片、截图与裁切",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-82",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8738,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 81,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "导入图片 · 截图",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-83",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 82,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "＋或工具列选截图後框选区域，Esc／右键取消；切作品／页面与逾时也取消。结果依原比例置入目前视野中心，不另存截图文件夹。Win+Shift+S图片可用Ctrl+V粘贴。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-84",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8892,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 83,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "可从档案总管拖PNG／JPG／BMP到画布，移动、缩放、旋转。选图片後色圆内裁切图片／恢撤销图，以原图像素范围裁切并保留来源。内建截图只使用此次结果，不读无关剪贴簿图。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-85",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9040,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 84,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "18 · 图钉与配色",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-86",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9102,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 85,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "图钉",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-87",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9164,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 86,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "上方图钉保存目前视野中心与倍率，点清单返回该视角。双击图钉或名称改名，Enter／点其他处保存、Esc取消；名称右键也可改名，支援Undo。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-88",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9256,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 87,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "右键图钉的图钉与文字配色，或图钉清单的配色，可分别改本体及文字。Windows保存可选配色，旧Mac版本重存作品可能移除此字段。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-89",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9348,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 88,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "开启图钉清单时先显示新增字段并聚焦名称，下面才是搜寻与既有图钉。清单使用与画布相同的图钉绘制及各自本体／文字颜色，方便依外观找到位置。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-90",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9496,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 89,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "19 · 屏幕画布",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-91",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9558,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 200,
      "zIndex": 90,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页侧栏、屏幕图示、更多工具或Ctrl+Alt+A启动，先存作品後隐藏主窗口；即时桌面上为独立透明注记层。握把拖四边停靠，仅图示模式不显示卷轴，工作区不足换行／换列；图文分页模式维持单行／单列并用箭头换组，清空与关闭保持可见。色圆、图层与调色盘有入口；图形填色请从「图形」选单设定，橡皮擦／雷射再点开设定。 屏幕画布支援的共用工具沿用一般工具列的显示设定与顺序；不提供图钉与视角锁定。「图形」选单包含相同的九种图形。 使用钢笔画出近似直线并停住一秒，预览会吸附成直线；移动超过12 pt会恢复自由笔迹。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-92",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9770,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 91,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "作画／操作或Ctrl+Alt+D切换注记与下层App操作。物件右键改样式、复制、副本、删除、锁定与层级，已多选物件保持整组；空白右键只取消未完成手势。Shift点击／拖框追加，左右框选依包含／碰到规则；套索可圈选相交物件；可移动、缩放、旋转、调端点，Shift限制线段／箭头水平或垂直。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-93",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 9922,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 92,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "T後点位置输入，Enter换行、Ctrl+Enter／完成提交、Esc取消；双击文字或更多→选择物件→编辑文字。换工具／操作模式、截图、另存、结束前提交草稿。样式只修改未锁定物件与有更动的字段，连续滑杆调整可一次Undo。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-94",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10044,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 93,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "截图或Ctrl+Alt+S将含注记区域成为原屏幕位置图片，不另存截图文件夹。更多→另存注记导出透明PNG或.heiban，更多→保存注记手动保存。×或Ctrl+Alt+Q保存独立注记并恢复主窗口，下次可继续；垃圾桶或Ctrl+Alt+K直接清空，可Undo。快捷键被占用时用工具列；屏幕注记不自动合并到主作品。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-95",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10252,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 94,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "20 · 保存、数据与导出",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-96",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10314,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 95,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页设定或更多→设定控制自动存档，默认关闭，成功保存後沿用。开启时一般约15秒、屏幕修改停止约1秒保存，手势未完延後；关闭停止定期作品保存。Ctrl+S手动存一般作品，屏幕更多→保存注记手动存。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-97",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10436,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 96,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "回首页、切作品／屏幕与正常退出都保存并等待，显示旋转进度；保存失败保持窗口与内容。关闭自动存档後，当机、断电或强制结束可能遗失未保存变更。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-98",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10528,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 97,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "导出先选目前页全部内容、选择物件或视野，再选.heiban、JSON、PNG、SVG、PDF、HTML。原稿／JSON保留所有页；图片与阅读格式依范围。PNG用画布renderer，SVG含向量／图片且富文字foreignObject需阅读器支援，PDF需Edge WebView2并附原稿，HTML可离线且含JSON。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-99",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10680,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 98,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "安装版数据在%LOCALAPPDATA%\\HeiBan\\Windows\\，Portable在程序旁Data/，Store使用自身App数据位置。迁移前正常关闭并备份完整文件夹，包括作品、垃圾桶及设定；Portable保留整个文件夹，不从ZIP内启动。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-100",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10802,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 99,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "首页「导入」可选 PDF、PPTX 或 PPT。每页转为一张锁定背景图片并建立笔记页面，可在上方注记。可选起讫页，一次最多 200 页、图片总量最多 100 MB；取消不建立半份作品。原文字与形状不会转成可编辑元素。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-101",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 10924,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 140,
      "zIndex": 100,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "PPT/PPTX 需要本机桌面版 PowerPoint；没有时请先转为 PDF。缺少字型可能改变版面，动画、影片、转场与互动不会保留；加密或损坏档案可能无法转换。导出 PDF 时，选「目前页面／全部内容」并勾选「PDF 导出全部页面」即可输出整本笔记；选择物件或目前视野则依该范围输出。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-102",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11132,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 101,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "21 · 快捷键速查",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-103",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11194,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 102,
      "strokeColor": "#57816c",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "撤销 · 重做 · 清除本页",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-104",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11256,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 103,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Ctrl+S保存；Ctrl+N新增；Ctrl+Z／Ctrl+Y撤销／重做；Ctrl+C／Ctrl+V复制选择／贴物件或图片；Delete删选择；Esc取消手势、截图与未完成形状。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-105",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11378,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 104,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "空白键+拖曳／中键拖曳平移；滚轮／Ctrl+滚轮缩放；V／P／E／T选择／画笔／橡皮擦／文字；Win+Shift+S後Ctrl+V剪取粘贴。屏幕快捷键均加Ctrl+Alt：A启动、D作画／操作、S截图、K清空、Q结束；其他App占用时用工具列。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-106",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11500,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "撤销与重做逐步还原／重新应用操作；清除本页会先要求确认，清除目前页物件，可撤销，其他页不受影响。选择後Delete只删除选择物件。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-107",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11648,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 106,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "22 · 程序更新",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-108",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11710,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 107,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "GitHub版首页→关於→更新设定，或更多→检查更新与更新设定。启动约10秒後背景检查，使用期间每6小时检查，可关闭自动更新／预览或手动检查，只在程序开启时执行；此项与自动存档分开。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-109",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11832,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 108,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "下载选正确架构与安装类型，核大小／SHA-256。保存成功且同一安装全部窗口关闭後由独立更新程序安装，下次启动使用，不强制退出或重开。离线、中断、占用档案保留目前版待重试；关闭自动更新後已暂存包也不自动应用。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-110",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 11954,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 170,
      "zIndex": 109,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Portable保留Data、portable.dat与未知档，安装版沿用数据位置；更新有备份，暂存与结果在%LOCALAPPDATA%\\HeiBan\\Updates\\，不传作品。安装期间不要拔碟或断电。Store由商店更新，不替换GitHub档；杂凑不等於Authenticode签章，首次可能有Windows提示。旧版本需先手动升级一次才能取得更新器。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-111",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12192,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 50,
      "zIndex": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "23 · 功能范围与已知限制",
      "fontSize": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-112",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12254,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 111,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "Windows 1.0.17 已获使用者同意制作 Microsoft Store 更新套件。实际上架依商店认证与发布结果；各装置相容性与已知限制请参阅开发纪录。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-113",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12346,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "zIndex": 112,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "云端／Google同步、协作、专用心智图、表格、公式、画框及外部PDF／SVG原稿编辑尚未交付。文件未知JSON字段保留；.heiban使用者文字维持原语言，介面切换不翻译作品。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-114",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
