      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "物件图层",
      "fontSize": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-119",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 12920,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 118,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "工具列或更多开物件图层，上层列在前。按图示左灰色双杠拖到另一列上半／下半，放开插其上／下；原列淡化、图示名称跟随、绿线指示位置。改名不改物件身份，空白名称恢复自动命名。",
      "fontSize": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "quickstart-zh-CN-120",
      "boardId": "heiban-windows-quickstart-v2",
      "pageId": "quickstart-all-tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 13012,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "zIndex": 119,
      "strokeColor": "#24533d",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "fillColor": "none",
      "opacity": 1,
      "isLocked": false,
      "text": "隐藏物件保留在面板，锁定防批次移动／删除，属性与图层为不同面板。方向／旋转游标、已存／待存图示、多选勾圈与橡皮擦范围表示目前动作；试用遇到异常请回报後再核准正式更新。",
      "fontSize": 18
    }
  ]
}